@host = http://localhost:5100
@customerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@productId = 01a066f1-65b1-722c-8ba6-6356cf6703e6

### The basket of a new customer - expect 200 OK with an empty items list
GET {{host}}/api/basket/{{customerId}}

### Add an item - expect 204 No Content
POST {{host}}/api/basket/{{customerId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "quantity": 2
}

### Add an invalid item - quantity outside 1..100; expect 400 with field errors
POST {{host}}/api/basket/{{customerId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "quantity": 0
}

### Remove one product from the basket - expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/basket/{{customerId}}/items/{{productId}}
